OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fand drizzle for some in the morning.
OL,7,FBecoming brighter and warm for a time
OL,8,Fin the afternoon, with a southeasterly
OL,9,Fbreeze picking up. Staying cooler
OL,10,Falong the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy and turning breezy for
OL,13,Fsome, with outbreaks of rain or
OL,14,Fdrizzle by Wednesday morning. A mild
OL,15,Fand muggy night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FRain and cloud slow to
OL,18,Fclear with possibly some heavy showers
OL,19,Fto follow, but sunny spells developing
OL,20,Flater in the afternoon. Wind easing in
OL,21,Fthe afternoon compared to the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
