OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FClear
OL,6,Fstart to Thursday with sunny spells in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon. A mix of cloudy periods
OL,8,Fand sunshine on Friday, remaining dry
OL,9,Ffor most. Cloudy periods but dry on
OL,10,FSaturday.
